---
layout: norn-docs.webc
title: Components
description: Every component in the patterns package, documented from its WebC comments.
---
<p>
  The components below come from <code>@allons-y/webc-patterns</code>, documented from the comments in each file. Each entry links to the props, slots, CSS hooks, and data the component reads.
</p>
<p>
  <span @text="webcdoc.components.length"></span> components are listed below.
</p>
<ul class="component-index">
  <li webc:for="component of webcdoc.components">
    <a :href="'/components/' + component.tagName + '/'" @text="component.tagName"></a>
    <span @text="component.summary"></span>
  </li>
</ul>
